    <string name="radar_info_text">Radar analyzes the frequency of words in messages.\n\nStandard behavior:\n• Search finds all occurrences of the word, even if included in others (e.g. \'work\' will also find \'workout\').\n• Suggestions appear after 3 characters and show the most used words.\n\nSearch options:\n• Aa: Toggles case sensitivity.\n• ab: Search only for the exact word, ignoring partial matches.\n• ?: Shows only messages containing a question mark.\n• Multi: Click to change mode:\n   - Multi: Search for the exact phrase.\n   - Multi: AND: Search for messages containing ALL words.\n   - Multi: OR: Search for messages containing AT LEAST ONE word.</string>

